<title>UK: Dresdner adds 100 million Sfr to June 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner adds 100 million Sfr to June 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 400 million Swiss francs from 300 million Swiss</p>
<p>francs, joint lead managers CSFB and Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER FINANCE BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    *400 MLN SFR  COUPON     2.25	MATURITY    26.JUN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.70    PAY DATE  **26.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STANDARD  MOODYS     AAA	 S&amp;P	   AA+</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 100 MLN SFR ON 23.MAY.96.</p>
<p>	     **FUNGIBLE ON PAYDAY</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
